WEBVTT

00:05:28.079 --> 00:05:30.342
that disconnect me from the world.

00:05:31.232 --> 00:05:33.538
Instead of being sealed off
in an automobile,

00:05:33.562 --> 00:05:35.235
I ride my bike,

00:05:35.259 --> 00:05:36.897
take buses and trains

00:05:36.921 --> 00:05:38.319
and walk a lot.

00:05:38.759 --> 00:05:43.739
And instead of a visually intensive
process in the studio, primarily,

00:05:43.763 --> 00:05:46.349
I'm also getting outdoors a lot more

00:05:46.373 --> 00:05:48.121
and using more of my senses.

00:05:49.096 --> 00:05:53.779
This landscape is a couple hours east
of San Diego, California.

00:05:53.803 --> 00:05:55.448
My brother lives out that way.

00:05:56.788 --> 00:05:59.493
He and I went camping there for four days.